{%- comment -%}
  GARELON · Envío gratis + pago seguro debajo de los botones de compra.

  - «Envío gratis»: solo comunica la oferta. La tarifa real (0 €) se configura en
    Shopify Admin › Configuración › Envío y entrega; el tema no la controla.
  - Métodos de pago, dos modos (ajuste icons_mode del bloque):
    · auto (por defecto): SOLO shop.enabled_payment_types, en el orden de Shopify, con los SVG
      oficiales (payment_type_svg_tag). Misma lista que el pie de Dawn (footer.liquid).
    · manual («Manual verificado»): lo que devuelve Shopify + los métodos que el dueño marque
      tras comprobarlos en Configuración › Pagos. Solo claves de payment_type_svg_tag
      (lista activemerchant/payment_icons). Orden fijo: tarjetas, carteras; sin duplicados.
    Ningún logo está escrito a mano ni subido como imagen.
  - En el editor de temas (request.design_mode) se muestra la lista que devuelve Shopify para
    poder comprobarla. El cliente nunca la ve.
  - No toca {{ form | payment_button }} ni el checkout: es información visual.
  - Sin garantías ni plazos inventados.

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} bloque garelon_payment_trust

  Usage:
  {% render 'garelon-payment-trust', block: block %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign show_shipping = false
  if block.settings.show_free_shipping and block.settings.free_shipping_label != blank
    assign show_shipping = true
  endif
  assign show_payment = false
  if block.settings.show_payment and block.settings.payment_label != blank
    assign show_payment = true
  endif

  assign shopify_types = shop.enabled_payment_types
  assign manual_added = ''
  if block.settings.icons_mode == 'manual'
    assign verified_keys = 'visa,master,american_express,maestro,unionpay,paypal,shopify_pay,apple_pay,google_pay,bizum' | split: ','
    assign pay_list = ''
    for key in verified_keys
      assign setting_id = 'pay_' | append: key
      if shopify_types contains key
        assign pay_list = pay_list | append: key | append: ','
      elsif block.settings[setting_id]
        assign pay_list = pay_list | append: key | append: ','
        assign manual_added = manual_added | append: key | append: ','
      endif
    endfor
    for type in shopify_types
      unless verified_keys contains type
        assign pay_list = pay_list | append: type | append: ','
      endunless
    endfor
    assign pay_types = pay_list | split: ','
    assign manual_added = manual_added | split: ','
  else
    assign pay_types = shopify_types
  endif

  assign show_icons = false
  if block.settings.show_icons and pay_types.size > 0
    assign show_icons = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if show_shipping or show_payment or show_icons -%}
  <div class="g-buytrust" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if show_shipping or show_payment -%}
      <ul class="g-buytrust__list" role="list">
        {%- if show_shipping -%}
          <li class="g-buytrust__item">
            <span class="g-buytrust__icon">{% render 'garelon-icon', icon: 'check' %}</span>
            <span class="g-buytrust__text">
              <span class="g-buytrust__label">{{ block.settings.free_shipping_label | escape }}</span>
              {%- if block.settings.free_shipping_note != blank -%}
                <span class="g-buytrust__note">{{ block.settings.free_shipping_note | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if show_payment -%}
          <li class="g-buytrust__item">
            <span class="g-buytrust__icon">{% render 'garelon-icon', icon: 'lock' %}</span>
            <span class="g-buytrust__text">
              <span class="g-buytrust__label">{{ block.settings.payment_label | escape }}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if show_icons -%}
      <ul class="g-pay" role="list" aria-label="{{ block.settings.payment_list_label | default: 'Métodos de pago aceptados' | escape }}">
        {%- for type in pay_types -%}
          <li class="g-pay__item">
            {{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'icon icon--full-color g-pay__icon' }}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if block.settings.show_icons and request.design_mode -%}
      <div class="g-editor-note g-pay-debug" role="note">
        <p>
          Métodos que Shopify devuelve:
          {% if shopify_types.size > 0 %}{{ shopify_types | join: ', ' }}{% else %}ninguno{% endif %}
        </p>
        {%- if block.settings.icons_mode == 'manual' -%}
          <p>
            Añadidos en «Manual verificado»:
            {% if manual_added.size > 0 %}{{ manual_added | join: ', ' }}{% else %}ninguno{% endif %}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if pay_types.size == 0 -%}
          <p>No se muestra ningún icono. Revisa Configuración › Pagos.</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p>Aviso visible solo en el editor de temas.</p>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
